<title>UK: John Lewis UK store sales up 12.7% in latest week.</title>
<headline>John Lewis UK store sales up 12.7% in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership JLP.CN said its UK weekly department store sales rose 12.7 percent in the week to July 12 from the same week a year earlier.</p>
<p>In the 24 weeks to July 12, sales were up 10.3 percent.</p>
<p>Total sales, including the Waitrose supermarket group, rose 10.1 percent in the latest week and 7.2 percent in the 24 week period. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
